<section>
  <h2>The Art of Weight</h2>
  <p>We believe value shouldn't be just digital. Our physical collectibles are struck with precision, featuring raised relief emblems and reeded edges designed to feel substantial in your palm. Each coin represents a commitment to scarcity and tangible worth.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Current Collections</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <!-- Bronze -->
    <div class="edition" data-edition="bronze" data-state="available">
      <div class="meta">
